on the surface settlement is analyzed.
(3) Based on the hypergeometric theory of tunneling, the hyperbolic Peck formula
is derived. By comparing the numerical simulation results, theoretical calculation data
and field measured data, the correctness of the numerical model is analyzed, and the
Peck formula is modified to predict the feasibility of surface settlement of curved
tunnel construction.
(4) Using the numerical model to establish the single curve and hyperbolic shield
excavation model, in the range of curvature radius R = 250 ~ 500 m, the smaller the
curvature radius of the curve tunnel is, the greater the amount of over-excavation
inside the tunnel is, the greater the settlement is, and the larger the offset is; in the
hyperbolic tunnel, the following tunnel disturbs the first tunnel, which will increase the
maximum surface settlement of the first tunnel.
(5) The numerical model is established to control a single variable, and the
influence of the thickness of the upper covering soil, grouting pressure, soil pressure
and segment elastic model on the surface subsidence is studied. When driving in the
same stratum, when the thickness of covering soil is between 7 m and 16 m, it has a
greater impact on the maximum value of surface settlement, and the excavation has a
smaller range of influence; when the thickness of covering soil is between 0. 1 MPa
and 0. 3 MPa, the surface settlement can be controlled by changing the grouting
pressure and soil pressure. Increasing the elastic modulus of the segment will reduce
the radial convergence of the tunnel and the surface settlement.
(6) Summarize and analyze the problems encountered in the engineering example,
and put forward the corresponding solutions. The axis of the curved tunnel is
controlled through the opening rate of the hinge angle, the utilization rate of the over
excavation cutter and the pre-correction technology; the earth surface settlement is
controlled by controlling the pressure of the soil bin and driving at a uniform speed;
the synchronous grouting speed and the grouting amount are controlled, and secondary
grouting is carried out in time for the position with poor grouting quality; the amount
of excavated soil is strictly controlled; Strictly control the segment quality, control the
Jack thrust of the shield machine, and reduce the influence of the tangential component
force on the segment.


